    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests {@link UtcInstant#toString()}. <p> A {@code UtcInstant} is built from a Modified Julian Day (MJD) and a nanosecond-of-day, and {@code toString()} renders it as an ISO-8601 string ending in {@code 'Z'}. These tests pin down that rendering across a range of cases: the epoch, fractional-second formatting at nanosecond/microsecond/ millisecond precision, whole hour/minute/second carries, and the leap second {@code 23:59:60}."
